    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Beautifully Renovated 3-Bedroom Family Home in Prime Coastal Location\r\n\r\nDixon Residential Estate Agents are delighted to present 34 Eastham Court to the Bettystown property market.\r\n\r\nThis stunning three-bedroom, two-bathroom semi-detached family home comes to market in excellent condition throughout and is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, growing families, investors, and those seeking a turnkey property in one of Meath’s most sought-after coastal locations.\r\n\r\nExtending over two well-appointed levels, the accommodation is both bright and spacious. Upon arrival, a welcoming entrance hallway leads into a generously sized living room. The current owners have thoughtfully opened up the space between the living room and kitchen/dining area, creating a modern open-plan layout that maximises natural light and provides an excellent flow throughout the home.\r\n\r\nThe stylish kitchen/dining area is finished to a high standard and offers ample storage and workspace, making it ideal for both everyday family living and entertaining guests. A separate utility room provides additional practicality and benefits from direct access to the side passage.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the accommodation comprises a spacious master bedroom with a modern en-suite bathroom, a second double bedroom, a generous single bedroom, and a beautifully finished family bathroom.\r\n\r\nOne of the standout features of this home is the superb rear garden. Recently renovated to an exceptional standard, the outdoor space has been carefully designed to provide a private and low-maintenance setting, perfect for outdoor dining, entertaining, or simply relaxing during the warmer months.\r\n\r\nLocated within the highly desirable Eastham Court development, residents enjoy the best of coastal living with Bettystown Beach just minutes away. Bettystown offers an excellent range of amenities including shops, cafés, restaurants, supermarkets, schools, golf courses, gyms, and numerous sporting and recreational facilities.\r\n\r\nFor commuters, the property is ideally positioned with easy access to the M1 Motorway, while Laytown Train Station and regular bus services provide convenient links to Dublin City Centre, Drogheda, and surrounding areas. The Matthews 910 service and D1 bus route offer excellent public transport options, making daily travel straightforward and convenient.\r\n\r\nCombining a superb coastal setting, modern interiors, excellent transport links, and a beautifully upgraded garden, 34 Eastham Court presents a rare opportunity to acquire a turnkey family home in a thriving seaside community.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
